# ws-shared hub: consumer installs get hub.gitignore written as .gitignore (config.json,
# STACK.md, MEMORY.md, CHANGELOG.md, memory/* stay local-only in consumer repos).
# This upstream repo tracks those dogfood files in git; package.json still excludes
# them from the npm tarball. Skill bodies under .agents/skills/ws-* are tracked SoT.
